    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "that's a strong start. i also need to address the tech companies' side for the sake of the show. they usually argue that allowing third-party repairs threatens user security and intellectual property. do you think their concerns about IP and security are actually legitimate, or are they just excuses to keep prices high?",
